---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Signup from '../components/Signup.astro';
import ExecCTA from '../components/ExecCTA.astro';
import { EMAIL } from '../config';
---
<Base
  title="Join"
  description="Technical and policy fellowships for Northeastern students, and applications for the executive team."
>
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Join</h1>
      <p class="lede join__lede">
        There are two ways to get involved! Join a fellowship to become a member, or apply to be
        on our executive board!
      </p>

      <div class="paths">
        <section class="path" aria-labelledby="fellowships">
          <h2 id="fellowships">Fellowships</h2>
          <span class="meta">Starts January 2027 · Weekly, 90 minutes</span>
          <p>
            We run two fellowships. Joining either one automatically makes you a general member.
          </p>

          <ol class="steps">
            <li>
              <h3>Technical Fellowship</h3>
              <p>
                An introduction to the technical side of AI safety: how modern AI systems are
                trained, why aligning them is difficult, and current research in areas such as
                mechanistic interpretability.
              </p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <h3>Policy Fellowship</h3>
              <p>
                An introduction to AI governance: the risks posed by advanced AI, how governments
                and companies are responding, and what effective policy could look like. No
                technical background required.
              </p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <h3>Membership</h3>
              <p>
                Members work on AI safety alongside other students, through research projects and
                discussion of current work.
              </p>
            </li>
          </ol>

          <p>
            Sign up for the mailing list, and we’ll email you before the fellowships begin.
            Already have a background in AI safety?
            <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>Email us</a> about joining as a member directly.
          </p>
          <div class="actions path__cta">
            <Signup />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="path" aria-labelledby="exec">
          <h2 id="exec">Executive team</h2>
          <span class="meta">Now recruiting · 3–5 hours a week</span>
          <p>
            The executive team runs the group. We are looking for a few students to each take on
            one area this year.
          </p>

          <ul class="steps">
            <li>
              <h3>Fellowships</h3>
              <p>Organize the technical and policy fellowships.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <h3>Events</h3>
              <p>Plan talks and socials.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <h3>Outreach</h3>
              <p>Handle communications and bring in new members.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <h3>Partnerships</h3>
              <p>Build connections with other AI safety groups and funders.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            You do not need a background in AI safety or machine learning, and several roles are
            not technical. Expect 3–5 hours a week, including one team meeting. If you are on
            co-op, we will work around it.
          </p>
          <div class="actions path__cta">
            <ExecCTA label="Apply to the executive team" />
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
